name issue_466_undershoot_very_low_capacity
describe 100 kbps link (as very_low_capacity), an encoder whose delta frames are 0.7x its target
compare_seeds 80
duration 40s
encoder_overshoot 0.7
at 0s capacity=100kbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
# Issue #466 (see issue_466_overshoot_1mbps.scn). At the encoder's minimum
# (52 kbps) the encoded rate is 34-36 kbps with overshoot 1 and 32-34 kbps at
# 0.7, with 391-440 frames dropped instead of 422-466 (seeds 1-3). The lines
# lock in the model's operating point; parity is judged on compare-webrtc.
expect video.encoder_target_avg_kbps > 45
expect video.avg_kbps < 40
